+    2.  Enter a loop that continues as long as `dda.step()` returns true [S1, S2, unofficial].
+    3.  Inside the loop, check if the current voxel coordinate `dda.voxel()` corresponds to an active node of type `NodeT` using `tester.template hasNode<NodeT>(dda.voxel())` [S1, S2, unofficial].
