+    2.  Initialize the tester with the starting time: `tester.init(dda.time())` [S1, S2, unofficial].
+    3.  Enter a loop that continues as long as `dda.step()` returns true [S1, S2, unofficial].
+    4.  Inside the loop, invoke the tester with the current voxel and time: `tester(dda.voxel(), dda.next())` [S1, S2, unofficial].
+    5.  If the tester returns true, return true immediately [S1, S2, unofficial].
+    6.  If the loop completes without returning true, return false [S1, S2, unofficial].
 
